  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31435414",
      "title": "Styling Place Items",
      "lectureOrder": 213,
      "videoOrder": 207,
      "sourceHash": "9c0964ca23d2ce60885eb1402552ea1a59bd5aa5c3edd0bd1f7ec4af0cde7225",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.54,
          "en": "So let's work on styling this place item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.54,
          "end": 7.21,
          "en": "to make sure that the image shows up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.21,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "and this overall looks a bit prettier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 13.7,
          "en": "For that, I already prepared this styles object down here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.7,
          "end": 15.32,
          "en": "this style sheet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.32,
          "end": 19.17,
          "en": "And now in there, I wanna add an item style object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 22.32,
          "en": "which will be applied to the overall container of the item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.32,
          "end": 24.803,
          "en": "In this case, this pressable component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.94,
          "end": 28.04,
          "en": "I will add a pressed style object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.04,
          "end": 30.89,
          "en": "because we will be able to press this later to navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.89,
          "end": 32.76,
          "en": "to a different screen and I wanna provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.76,
          "end": 35.593,
          "en": "some visual feedback when the item is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.79,
          "end": 39.43,
          "en": "We will also need some styling for the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.43,
          "end": 43.12,
          "en": "And then also for the container that holds the info text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.12,
          "end": 46.32,
          "en": "So this view, which holds the title and the address",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 50.34,
          "en": "and then also for the title and the address themselves,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.34,
          "end": 53.253,
          "en": "so for these two text items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "Now let's start with the item overall,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 61.04,
          "en": "as always it's totally up to you how things should look like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.04,
          "end": 63.62,
          "en": "but I will start by setting flex direction to row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.62,
          "end": 67.56,
          "en": "to make sure that the image and this view are side by side",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.56,
          "end": 70.56,
          "en": "so that the image is on the left side of the item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 73.03999999999999,
          "en": "and the helper text, the title and the address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.03999999999999,
          "end": 74.763,
          "en": "is to the right of the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.88,
          "end": 79.17,
          "en": "I will add line items, flex start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 81.09,
          "en": "to make sure that all the content is moved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.09,
          "end": 83.623,
          "en": "to the vertical top of this row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.52,
          "end": 86.64,
          "en": "And then add some rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 88.85300000000001,
          "en": "with border radius six here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.2,
          "end": 93.19,
          "en": "We can also add a vertical margin here of 12",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.19,
          "end": 96.88300000000001,
          "en": "so that there is some distance between multiple list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.28999999999999,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "And give those items a background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 106.2,
          "en": "of colors using this colors constant which is imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.2,
          "end": 107.833,
          "en": "from constants colors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 114.44,
          "en": "Colors.primary500 for example which is a medium blue color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.13,
          "end": 120.1,
          "en": "I also want to add some shadows so I will set elevation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.1,
          "end": 124.42,
          "en": "to two and then basically apply the same shadow setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.42,
          "end": 129.42,
          "en": "I used before in this course already on my button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.72,
          "end": 133.38,
          "en": "And hence, I will just copy my shadow properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.38,
          "end": 137.13,
          "en": "from there, shadow color, shadow opacity, shadow offset,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.13,
          "end": 142.13,
          "en": "and shadow radius and add them here below elevation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.79,
          "end": 145.06,
          "en": "Of course you can also tweak the values, but for me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.06,
          "end": 146.363,
          "en": "they will work like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.53,
          "end": 149.73,
          "en": "On pressed, I want to change the opacity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.73,
          "end": 151.86,
          "en": "as we did before in this course as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.86,
          "end": 155.98,
          "en": "And here I just wanna have a very light transparency effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.98,
          "end": 158.483,
          "en": "which is why I set it to 0.9.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 159.98,
          "end": 162.23,
          "en": "And then for the image I'll add flex one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 162.23,
          "end": 164.72,
          "en": "so that it takes all the space it can get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.72,
          "end": 167.65,
          "en": "relative to other elements in the same container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 167.65,
          "end": 169.94,
          "en": "that might also have the flex property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.94,
          "end": 173.91,
          "en": "And I will indeed also add it to the info style object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.91,
          "end": 176.41,
          "en": "which will be applied to this view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.41,
          "end": 178.76,
          "en": "which is in the same container as image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.76,
          "end": 181.04,
          "en": "They are both directly impressible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.04,
          "end": 184.24,
          "en": "So this view and this image are siblings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.24,
          "end": 188.34,
          "en": "And by adding flex here as well, and setting flex to two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.34,
          "end": 191.62,
          "en": "I will make sure that this is twice as big as the image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.62,
          "end": 194.57,
          "en": "So, this takes one third of the available space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.57,
          "end": 197.683,
          "en": "this takes two thirds of the available space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.18,
          "end": 202.75,
          "en": "Then on this image I also will make sure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.75,
          "end": 206.24,
          "en": "the rounded corners by the parent container are respected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.24,
          "end": 209.15,
          "en": "And therefore I will set the two left corners,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 209.15,
          "end": 212.96,
          "en": "the border bottom left radius to four",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 212.96,
          "end": 216.89,
          "en": "and the border top left radius to four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.89,
          "end": 218.54,
          "en": "So that on the left side",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.54,
          "end": 222.07,
          "en": "these two corners are rounded because the image will be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.07,
          "end": 225.163,
          "en": "on the left side of this overall item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.45,
          "end": 227.32999999999998,
          "en": "Last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.32999999999998,
          "end": 231.12,
          "en": "I'll give this image a height of 100 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.12,
          "end": 234.62,
          "en": "Now for info, besides setting flex two here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.62,
          "end": 238.05,
          "en": "I also wanna add some padding so that we have some spacing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 238.05,
          "end": 240.87,
          "en": "between the address and the text content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.87,
          "end": 243.26,
          "en": "that is inside of this box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.26,
          "end": 245.84,
          "en": "And then for the text content, for the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.84,
          "end": 249.83,
          "en": "I'll set font weight bold and ramp up the font size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.83,
          "end": 251.523,
          "en": "to let's say 18,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.37,
          "end": 256.96,
          "en": "and I'll give this a color of Colors.gray700, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 260.39,
          "end": 264.56,
          "en": "And I will copy these two settings, font size and color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 264.56,
          "end": 267.803,
          "en": "to the address but there set the font size to 12.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 269.19,
          "end": 272.51,
          "en": "Now these styles can be added to the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 272.51,
          "end": 276.1,
          "en": "and here for pressable again, as so often,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 276.1,
          "end": 279.35,
          "en": "style will receive a function where we get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.35,
          "end": 283.11,
          "en": "this pressed property which is destructured from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 283.11,
          "end": 286.45,
          "en": "this object that's passed into this function automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 286.45,
          "end": 291.03,
          "en": "And we always add the item style but we then check press",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.03,
          "end": 294.343,
          "en": "to conditionally add the pressed style as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 295.27,
          "end": 299.603,
          "en": "Now on the image, we of course add styles.image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 300.49,
          "end": 304.28,
          "en": "On this view, we add styles.info",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 304.28,
          "end": 308.14,
          "en": "and then on the first text it's styles.title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 308.14,
          "end": 313.14,
          "en": "and on the second text, it is of course styles.address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.61,
          "end": 319.48,
          "en": "If we save all of that, this is what we should get here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.48,
          "end": 321.113,
          "en": "This is how it should look like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 322.55,
          "end": 325.42,
          "en": "Now of course, I also wanna have some space around these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 325.42,
          "end": 327.97,
          "en": "list items and therefore we can also style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 327.97,
          "end": 329.97,
          "en": "the place list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.97,
          "end": 334.25,
          "en": "And there, I will add a new list style where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 334.25,
          "end": 337.52,
          "en": "I actually wanna set a margin in all directions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 337.52,
          "end": 340.803,
          "en": "of 24 to have some spacing around the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.68,
          "end": 345.4,
          "en": "And this will be added as a style to the flat list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.4,
          "end": 348.7,
          "en": "So there we can set style equal to styles.list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 350.33,
          "end": 353.46,
          "en": "and with this in place now there is some space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 353.46,
          "end": 355.563,
          "en": "around the list items as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 356.55,
          "end": 358.03,
          "en": "So we can also tap them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 358.03,
          "end": 359.93,
          "en": "even though at the moment nothing happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 359.93,
          "end": 362.853,
          "en": "but this is how our list items look like now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 363.89,
          "end": 367,
          "en": "And that is again another step forward because now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 367,
          "end": 371.15,
          "en": "we can output and display a nice looking list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 371.15,
          "end": 374.9,
          "en": "The next step before we make sure that we can also tap them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 374.9,
          "end": 377.29,
          "en": "and navigate to the detail screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 377.29,
          "end": 380.4,
          "en": "the next step before we do that will be to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 380.4,
          "end": 384.1,
          "en": "that we store them on the device in some device storage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 384.1,
          "end": 387.83299999999997,
          "en": "to be precise in a database that's running on the device.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
